  "description": "SEWRUL crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H64 Cl6 Dy4 N6 O14,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.606-3.860 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.27-112.81°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(HL)2(μ3-OH)2Cl6]·4CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
